--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- RECO PROJECT ESCALATION AUTOMATION
-- PROCESS_BASELINE - DBEAVER-FRIENDLY END-TO-END TEST SCRIPT
--
-- Package:
--   RECO.RECO_PROJ_ESCALATION_AUTO_PROCESS
--
-- Procedure:
--   PROCESS_BASELINE
--
-- PURPOSE
--   1. Confirm PROCESS_FUNDING completed successfully.
--   2. Confirm escalation rows are eligible for baseline processing.
--   3. Capture working and current baseline budget state before execution.
--   4. Confirm funded agreement/project funding evidence exists.
--   5. Execute PROCESS_BASELINE.
--   6. Confirm the working budget was baselined successfully.
--   7. Confirm BASELINED status and process log were created.
--   8. Confirm escalation rows were frozen and applied audit fields populated.
--   9. Confirm rerun creates no duplicate baseline or log.
--
-- DBEAVER NOTES
--   * Enable DBMS Output:
--       View -> Panels -> DBMS Output
--       Click "+" and enable the current connection.
--   * Run each section separately and save the results.
--   * Replace PROJECT_NUMBER = 20422 where needed.
--   * Do not COMMIT until all after-state validations pass.
--
-- CURRENT PACKAGE ELIGIBILITY
--   FREEZE_FLAG = 'N'
--   CURRENT_ESCALATION_FLAG = 'Y'
--   APPROVAL_STATUS = 'APPROVED'
--   STATUS IN ('FUNDED', 'BASELINE_ERROR')
--
-- CURRENT PACKAGE BASELINE FLOW
--   1. Locate the current working budget.
--   2. Rename it to:
--        ESCALATION UPDATE - MM/DD/YYYY
--   3. Set working-budget BURDENED_COST = RAW_COST where different.
--   4. Set escalation budget-line BURDENED_COST = RAW_COST where:
--        PM_PRODUCT_CODE = 'RECO_ESC'
--   5. Call PA_BUDGET_PUB.BASELINE_BUDGET.
--   6. Insert BASELINE / BASELINED process log.
--   7. Update all project escalation rows to STATUS = BASELINED.
--   8. Set FREEZE_FLAG = Y and populate APPLIED_BY/APPLIED_DATE.
--
-- IMPORTANT DESIGN OBSERVATIONS
--   * Baseline processing is project-level, not ESC_SETUP_ID-level.
--   * UPDATE_BASELINE_STATUS passes only PROJECT_ID, so all matching escalation
--     rows for the project may be updated.
--   * FREEZE_ESCALATION also updates by PROJECT_ID.
--   * PROCESS_ALREADY_COMPLETED check is commented out.
--   * Duplicate prevention depends primarily on STATUS/FREEZE_FLAG changes.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. INITIALIZE EBS ORGANIZATION CONTEXT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- EXPECTED:
--   Completes successfully.
--   Run again after opening a new DBeaver session.

BEGIN
    get_reco_organization(0);
END;
/

